1 0 obj<</Author(RetiredGoth)/CreationDate(D:20261101034828+00'00')/Creator(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Keywords(Fanworks, Teen And Up Audiences, She-Ra and the Princesses of Power \(2018\), Entrapta/Hordak \(She-Ra\), Entrapta \(She-Ra\), Hordak \(She-Ra\), Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner \(She-Ra\), Imp \(She-Ra\), Micah \(She-Ra\), Fluff, Angst, Romance, Fairy Tale Retellings, The POV switches like it's playing hot potato, Olympic Level Mental Gymnastics, everyone is a little ooc, Implied sex but no smut, Prime and the rebellion are mentioned and important in the background but not really in this, Used an older version of the story because we love our boy Hordak but Flynn Ryder he is not, I promise it ends well happy endings just have to be earned, Vague time skips between chapters, Inaccurate depictions of concussion treatments, I dont hate Shadow Weaver she was just the best candidate for the role of the sorceress, Dont trade babies for plants, Not Beta Read, bad grammar, The Writer Is Delulu, This story probably deserves a better author but Im the one it gets, I'm Sorry, F/M, Choose Not To Use Archive Warnings, The technical jargon is vague because I'm not smart enough to write it, rapunzel - Freeform)/ModDate(D:20261101034828+00'00')/Producer(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Title(Fine as Spun Lilac)>>
