          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Fine as Spun Lilac</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Challenged myself to make something for one of my favorite ships.&lt;br /&gt;This is a re-telling of the fairy tale, Rapunzel, with an Entrapdak spin on it. Honestly, it was meant to be a much shorter one shot, that followed the structure of the Grimmâ€™s tale more closely, but then it took on a life of its own and now here we are.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;There was once in the kingdom of Dryl a royal couple dedicated to the discipline of science who were recently blessed with a daughter named Entrapta. These kings were fascinated by the garden where a peculiar sorceress practiced her craft and unwittingly fall into a bargain they were not prepared to make.&lt;br /&gt;Alone in her tower deep within the Whispering Woods, Entrapta spends her days building machines whose purpose is unclear to her. Until Lord Hordak decides it's time to keep a closer eye on the activities of his less than trustworthy advisor.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>RetiredGoth</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Teen And Up Audiences</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Entrapta/Hordak (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Entrapta (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Hordak (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Imp (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Micah (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Fluff</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Angst</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Romance</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Fairy Tale Retellings</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>The POV switches like it's playing hot potato</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Olympic Level Mental Gymnastics</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>everyone is a little ooc</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Implied sex but no smut</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Prime and the rebellion are mentioned and important in the background but not really in this</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Used an older version of the story because we love our boy Hordak but Flynn Ryder he is not</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>I promise it ends well happy endings just have to be earned</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Vague time skips between chapters</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Inaccurate depictions of concussion treatments</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>I donâ€™t hate Shadow Weaver she was just the best candidate for the role of the sorceress</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Donâ€™t trade babies for plants</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Not Beta Read</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>bad grammar</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>The Writer Is Delulu</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>This story probably deserves a better author but Iâ€™m the one it gets</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>I'm Sorry</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/M</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Choose Not To Use Archive Warnings</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>The technical jargon is vague because I'm not smart enough to write it</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>rapunzel - Freeform</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Bag>
